        "description": "Cognitive impairment or intellectual disability",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity, thin corpus callosum on MRI, and pathogenic mutation in the SPG15 gene",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is supported by clinical features and genetic confirmation; exclusion of other causes of spastic paraplegia is essential."
